[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   independent of the perihelion epoch.  A heliospheric/interface boundary
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   advects with the Local Interstellar Cloud flow (~26 km/s), and a
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   catalogue quality systematic would relax as orbit determination
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   improved -- both predict an epoch trend.  The measured per-comet
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   unexplained slip (step_065 residual after the encounter-budget
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   regression) is tested against perihelion year, inside and outside the
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   axis cap, per cohort and pooled, and across the photographic->CCD era
[2026-09-20 11:30:18 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 072]   boundary.
